   "description": "<p>Bitcoin is the first widely used decentralized digital currency. It uses cryptography for security and is based on a peer-to-peer network. It was created in 2009 by an unknown individual or group of individuals using the pseudonym \"Satoshi Nakamoto.\" Transactions with bitcoin are recorded on a public ledger called the &lsquo;blockchain&rsquo; which Satoshi first coined and popularized. Users can manage their bitcoin using a wallet that stores their private keys. Bitcoin can be used for a variety of purposes, including purchasing goods and services, trading, and investing.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.blockchain.com/explorer?view=btc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View blockchain activity</a></p>",
