   "description": "<p>Ethereum is a smart contract decentralized application blockchain. It was developed by Vitalik Buterin and launched in 2015. Ethereum is based on a distributed computing platform and has its own programming language, which allows developers to build and deploy decentralized applications. Unlike bitcoin, which is primarily used as a digital currency, Ethereum is used to build and run applications on its blockchain. These applications can be used for a wide variety of purposes, such as tracking supply chain data, managing financial contracts, and enabling secure online voting.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View blockchain activity</a></p>",
